<title>USA: TABLE - Aviall Inc Q2 oper net rises.</title>
<headline>TABLE - Aviall Inc Q2 oper net rises.</headline>
<dateline>DALLAS 1997-07-22</dateline>
<text>
<p>1997			1996</p>
<p> Shr			  $0.31		    $0.54</p>
<p> Net			  6,127		   10,471</p>
<p> Revs			96,063		   93,594</p>
<p> Avg shrs		  19,946		   19,556</p>
<p>	  6  MONTHS</p>
<p> Shr			  $0.66		    $0.35</p>
<p> Net			 13,070		    6,744</p>
<p> Revs		     187,745		  185,762</p>
<p> Avg shrs		  19,820		   19,507</p>
<p>(All data above 000s except per share numbers)</p>
<p>Q2 1997 operating net per share was profit $0.31 vs loss of $29,000, or nil per share. For Q2 1996 the company had a $10.5 million gain, or $0.54 per share, from disposing of discontinued engine services business.</p>
<p>Six-month 1997 operating net per share was profit $0.66 vs loss $0.19 for first-half 1996.</p>
<p>1996 results included aerospace fastener business sold in Q3 1996.</p>
</text>
